    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.OmniMix 是由 Dr.Hydra 维护的 Windows 音乐聚合、桌面播放控制和游戏集成播放器。">OmniMix is a Windows music aggregator, desktop playback controller, and game-integration player maintained by Dr.Hydra.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.当前版本以 VB.NET/WPF 桌面前端连接本机 .NET 后端，优先通过 OmniMix SDK 与 gRPC-Web 访问播放、曲库和实例能力；REST 仅保留给后端配置、模块 UI、模块设置、模块启停和停止后端等兼容功能。桌面 GUI、系统媒体控制、FH6 桥接和游戏 Mod 都作为同一后端模型的客户端工作。">This release uses a VB.NET/WPF desktop frontend connected to a local .NET backend. Playback, library, and instance features primarily use the OmniMix SDK and gRPC-Web; REST remains for compatibility features such as backend configuration and module management. The desktop GUI, system media controls, FH6 bridge, and game mods all act as clients of the same backend model.</sys:String>
