    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.主页左侧集中显示封面、进度和基础控制，右侧默认显示播放列表，并可在播放列表、历史和歌词之间切换。">The left side of the home page shows artwork, progress, and basic controls. The right side shows the playlist and can switch between playlist, history, and lyrics.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.前端会按设置启动或连接后端；完整包会随带后端、模块、原生库、Web 资源、媒体生成器、配置文件和 VB.NET 桌面前端。">The frontend starts or connects to the backend according to your settings. Complete packages include the backend, modules, native libraries, web resources, media generator, configuration, and VB.NET desktop frontend.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.聚合本地文件夹、网易云、QQ音乐、酷狗、酷我、哔哩哔哩、Spotify 等来源；支持模块页面、登录状态、个人歌单导入、歌词和翻译歌词能力（取决于平台返回内容）。">Aggregates local folders, NetEase Cloud Music, QQ Music, Kugou, Kuwo, Bilibili, Spotify, and other sources. Module pages, sign-in state, personal playlist import, lyrics, and translated lyrics are supported when provided by the platform.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.播放页和悬浮窗支持歌词、双语歌词和纯歌词模式；悬浮窗可独立设置显示状态、横版/竖版/纯歌词样式、主题配色、背景配色、窗口透明度、背景透明度和缩放。">The playback page and Now Playing window support lyrics, bilingual lyrics, and lyrics-only mode. The window has independent visibility, layout, theme, background, opacity, and scale settings.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.通过 SMTC 注册系统媒体控制，支持键盘、耳机和系统媒体面板触发播放、暂停、上一首和下一首。">Registers system media controls through SMTC, allowing keyboards, headsets, and the system media panel to play, pause, skip back, and skip forward.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.推荐使用安装器或完整便携包。便携包解压到可写目录后运行 OmniMixPlayer.Gui.Vbnet.exe；前端会优先查找同目录的 OmniMixPlayer.Backend.exe，也可以在设置中手动指定后端路径。">Use the installer or complete portable package. Extract the portable package to a writable folder and run OmniMixPlayer.Gui.Vbnet.exe. The frontend first looks for OmniMixPlayer.Backend.exe beside it; a custom backend path can also be selected in Settings.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.在播放页选择桌面或游戏实例并控制播放；在音源页面浏览歌曲、歌单和模块内容，将歌曲加入队列或直接播放。主页右侧默认显示队列，也可以切换到历史或歌词。">Select a desktop or game instance on the Playback page. Browse songs, playlists, and module content on the Sources page, then queue or play tracks directly. The home page shows the queue by default and can switch to history or lyrics.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.部分在线音源需要在音源管理页面完成登录或授权。网易云、QQ音乐、酷我已按 2.0.0 模块更新，酷狗已按 2.0.1 模块更新；若连续多首歌曲无法播放，优先检查账号状态、会员权限和平台版权限制。">Some online sources require sign-in or authorization on the Sources page. If several tracks fail in succession, check the account state, subscription permissions, and regional or copyright restrictions first.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.在设置 - 悬浮窗设置中启用播放悬浮窗，并选择横向、竖向或纯歌词模式。纯歌词模式只显示歌词、进度和播放控制，适合桌面常驻。">Enable the Now Playing window under Settings, then choose horizontal, vertical, or lyrics-only mode. Lyrics-only mode shows just lyrics, progress, and playback controls for an unobtrusive desktop display.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.系统媒体控制通过 SMTC 初始化。若耳机或键盘媒体键失效，请先确认 OmniMix 后端正在运行，并检查系统媒体面板中是否出现 OmniMix。">System media controls use SMTC. If headset or keyboard media keys do not work, make sure the OmniMix backend is running and OmniMix appears in the system media panel.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.进入音源管理 - 游戏集成，选择游戏目录并安装对应桥接组件。启动游戏前建议先启动 OmniMix，让前端刷新端口文件、实例 ID 和随包桥接版本。">Open Sources - Game Integrations, choose the game directory, and install the appropriate bridge. Start OmniMix before the game so it can refresh the port file, instance ID, and bundled bridge version.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.FH6 需要将游戏内 DJ 调整为关、主播模式调整为开并重启游戏。Steam 与 Xbox 版目录结构不同，前端会自动识别实际运行目录、根桥接位置和 media 目录。">FH6 requires the in-game DJ to be off and Streamer Mode to be on, followed by a game restart. Steam and Xbox editions use different directory layouts; the frontend detects the runtime, bridge, and media directories automatically.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.在 FH6 集成页面可选择 PNG 图片并输入电台名称，前端会调用媒体生成器备份原始文件并写入生成后的 media 文件。">On the FH6 integration page, choose a PNG image and enter a radio name. The frontend uses the media generator to back up the originals and write the generated media files.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.FH6 进出比赛时默认继续播放；可在设置中改为下一首。若更新后显示或音频异常，请重新安装 FH6 集成并重启游戏。">FH6 keeps playing when entering or leaving races by default; this can be changed to Next Track in Settings. If visuals or audio break after an update, reinstall the FH6 integration and restart the game.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.卸载前请先在游戏集成页面移除桥接组件；如果游戏内无法连接、歌曲信息不同步或仍显示旧版本，可使用修复实例绑定或重新安装集成。">Remove bridge components from Game Integrations before uninstalling. If the game cannot connect, track metadata is out of sync, or an old version remains, repair the instance binding or reinstall the integration.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.FH6 集成通过根桥接方式接入 OmniMix 后端，支持游戏内音频流、歌曲信息写入、媒体资源生成、集成版本检测、实例绑定修复和比赛开始播放行为设置。">The FH6 root bridge connects to the OmniMix backend and supports in-game audio streaming, track metadata, media generation, version checks, instance-binding repair, and race-start playback behavior.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.桌面前端 4.4.1；FH6 Omni Bridge 4.0.0；网易云、QQ音乐、酷我模块 2.0.0，酷狗模块 2.0.1。">Desktop frontend 4.4.1; FH6 Omni Bridge 4.0.0; NetEase, QQ Music, and Kuwo modules 2.0.0; Kugou module 2.0.1.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.B站：space.bilibili.com/441133155；小黑盒：用户 38080236；QQ群：851586605。">Bilibili: space.bilibili.com/441133155; Heybox: user 38080236; QQ group: 851586605.</sys:String>
