    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Source.反馈时请尽量说明复现步骤、当前版本、使用的音源模块、是否启用了桌面播放器或游戏集成，并附上压缩后的日志。">When reporting an issue, include reproduction steps, the current version, active source modules, whether desktop playback or game integrations are enabled, and a compressed log archive.</sys:String>
